{"title":"Kamala's perpetual \"Veep\" episode","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode","date":1754066932000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you wait for every website on the internet to verify your age.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/7d02bfcc-0ac6-4bcc-a0df-a88678829684/Screenshot_2025-08-01_at_11.14.19_AM.png?t=1754061273\" /><div><span><p>(<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/davidlynch/comments/1m9p95o/managed_to_pass_the_uks_stupid_new_selfie_age/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">reddit.com/r/davidlynch</a>)</p></span></div></div><p>This week, the Epstein controversy is heating up, so President Trump is <a href=\"https://www.thedailybeast.com/trump-backs-qanon-call-to-be-calm-in-storm-over-epstein/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">calling in Q</a> for help. Meanwhile, Democrats are <a href=\"https://thehill.com/homenews/senate/5431086-senate-democrats-trump-agenda/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">going all out</a>, busting out their most obscure <a href=\"https://www.cbsnews.com/news/senate-democrats-seek-to-force-jeffrey-epstein-files-release-rule-of-five-law/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">procedural rules</a> and calling in former Vice President Kamala Harris to announce <i>What Happened 2: </i><a href=\"https://www.cnn.com/2025/07/31/politics/kamala-harris-book-campaign?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\"><i>What Happened Harder</i></a>. Is democracy's best hope <a href=\"https://nypost.com/2025/07/30/us-news/mystery-orange-shape-spotted-near-jeffrey-epsteins-jail-cell-night-before-his-death-report/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">The Mysterious Orange Shape</a>? Or maybe it's the <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/features/2025-luke-farritor-doge/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">DOGE script kiddie</a> who just wanted to help. Things are bleak right now, and reviewing Vice President JD Vance's <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/i-listened-to-the-alleged-spotify-playlists-of-trump-officials-for-five-hours-heres-what-i-learned/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify playlist</a> isn't helping. If you want to hear more, just give <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/analysis/715767/online-age-verification-not-ready?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">every single website</a> your ID — or, if you'd prefer, just use <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/davidlynch/comments/1m9p95o/managed_to_pass_the_uks_stupid_new_selfie_age/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">a Funko Pop</a>.</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/t/ZP8k6DRj1/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">Watch this man in Edinburgh fold a fitted sheet</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/starvingtwoman/status/1950742461032059262?s=12&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">Gooning email</a> (X post)</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/drwilsonbutt/790486405290803200/wow-guys-weve-really-come-together-to-make-this?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">Home M.D.</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/sour-charity/790431025603952640/this-tweet-is-stuck-in-my-head-i-keep-saying?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">Matcha pilates in bali before a labubu</a><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/sour-charity/790431025603952640/this-tweet-is-stuck-in-my-head-i-keep-saying?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\"> rave</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@nimfa.edek/video/7531679234490649878?_r=1&amp;_t=ZP-8yW4nXjVTFG&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\">Good bird</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Weekend_as_a_28-Year-Old_in_Chicago?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\"><i>My Weekend as a 28-Year-Old in Chicago</i></a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/Todd_Spence/status/1950333943531917662?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Sopranos</i></a><a href=\"https://x.com/Todd_Spence/status/1950333943531917662?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=kamala-s-perpetual-veep-episode\" target=\"_blank\"> + </a><i><a href=\"https://x.com/Todd_Spence/status/1950333943531917662?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_med